# =============================================================================
# AccidentalHero — what gets versioned
#
# Committed: C++ source, config, docs, and the content we authored — Blueprints,
# items, recipes, UI widgets, and the world itself (Maps + __ExternalActors__).
#
# Excluded: build output (regenerated by the engine) and marketplace/Fab packs
# (re-downloadable, ~7.5 GB, and often not licensed for public redistribution).
#
# Consequence: a fresh clone will NOT open cleanly until the Fab packs listed at
# the bottom of this file are re-installed. That is the deliberate trade for a
# repo that fits inside free GitHub and LFS limits.
# =============================================================================

# --- Engine build artifacts (outputs, not sources) ---------------------------
# Matches at any depth, so plugin build output is covered too. ~12 GB.
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/

# --- IDE and OS noise --------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.idea/
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.sdf
*.suo
*.sln
*.slnx
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
*.dmp
*.utrace
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Marketplace / Fab content (re-downloadable) -----------------------------
# Procedural Nature Seasons Pack — trees, grass, rocks, landscape textures
/Content/ProceduralNtr_vol2/
# Old West set — town and blacksmith props
/Content/OldWest/
# GV Free Shrubs Pack
/Content/GV_FreeShrubsPack/
# Free Lava Material (folder name contains a non-ASCII dash, hence the glob)
/Content/Free_Lava_Material_*/
# Lava textures copied out of the pack above; the loose materials beside it are ours
/Content/Materials/Lava/
# Fab downloads
/Content/Fab/

# --- Third-party plugins -----------------------------------------------------
# Voxel plugin: installed but entirely unused (see docs/SPEC.md §7 Out of scope).
/Plugins/VoxelFree/

# VibeUE is its own git repository with its own upstream:
#     https://github.com/kevinpbuckley/VibeUE.git
# Committing it here would record a bare gitlink with no submodule config, which
# clones as an empty folder. Clone it separately into Plugins/ instead.
/Plugins/VibeUE/

# --- Local machine state -----------------------------------------------------
# Per-machine tool permissions, not project configuration.
/.claude/

# Editor/cooker profiling logs
/Build/*/FileOpenOrder/

# Stray marketplace promo image left at the project root
/OldWest_VOL4.png
